{"path":"thread/shared_future/operator=","title":"std::shared_future<T>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::shared_future&lt;T&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/operator=","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Assigns the contents of another shared_future.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n</tbody>\n<tbody class=\"t-dcl-rev t-dcl-rev-num\"><tr class=\"t-dcl-rev-aux\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td></td>\n<td rowspan=\"142\">(1)</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx17\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">shared_future<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> shared_future<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> </td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx17\">(until C++17)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">shared_future<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> shared_future<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">shared_future<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> shared_future<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Assigns the contents of another <code>shared_future</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Releases any shared state and assigns the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>. After the assignment, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>valid<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> other.<span class=\"me1\">valid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Releases any shared state and move-assigns the contents of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>. After the assignment, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other.<span class=\"me1\">valid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/shared_future/valid\">this-&gt;valid()</a></span> will yield the same value as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other.<span class=\"me1\">valid</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> before the assignment.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>std::shared_future</code> that will transfer state to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/shared_future","title":"std::shared_future"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::shared_future<T>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++17, since C++17. Assigns the contents of another shared_future."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++17"],"wordCount":99,"codeBlockCount":0}
